*.md
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md
# Repository-scoped skill instructions and references are durable workflow source.
!.agents/skills/**/*.md
# Stable role charters are durable workflow authority.
!.agents/roles/
!.agents/roles/*.md
# Canonical project memory + plan docs are load-bearing collaboration state — track them
# (scratch under memory/backup_*/ and memory/tmp/ stays ignored via the bare *.md rule).
!memory/*.md
# Project control plane is load-bearing collaboration state.
!docs/project/*.md
!docs/project/current-work/
!docs/project/current-work/**/*.md
!docs/session-workspaces/
!docs/session-workspaces/**/*.md
!docs/report/*.md
!docs/plans/*.md
!docs/superpowers/plans/*.md
!docs/superpowers/specs/*.md
# CDC records are durable algorithm-research state.
!docs/research/cdc/**/*.md
# PM-accepted active research designs are durable algorithm source.
!docs/research/designs/*.md
# Custom subagent definitions are durable project tooling.
!.claude/agents/*.md
# Visual brainstorming and runtime capability probes are local scratch.
.superpowers/
# User-requested isolated Git worktrees for parallel HMASD implementation.
.worktrees/
# Generated from the account-visible Codex model cache; never commit account
# catalog contents. Rebuild with .codex/refresh-model-catalog-v2-workaround.ps1.
runtime/model-catalog-v2-workaround.json
# Exact R27-G2 design/review evidence is durable project state.
!docs/research/R27_G2_FORCED_Z_TRAJECTORY_EFFECT_DESIGN_20260712.md
!docs/external-review/R27_G2_design_review_20260712_Claude.md
!docs/external-review/gemini_3_1_pro/**/*.md
!docs/external-review/gpt5_6_pro/**/*.md
!docs/external-review/rounds/**/*.md
!docs/external-review/GPT5_6_PRO_OPEN_HANDOFF_TEMPLATE.md
!docs/external-review/OPEN_REVIEW_PRINCIPLES.md
!docs/external-review/CONVERGENT_REVIEW_PRINCIPLES.md
!docs/operations/R27_G2_REMOTE_AUTOMATION_20260712.md
# LTM holds the rotated long-form history the compact files point at. It is the
# archive half of the compact-memory contract, so it must be tracked too.
!memory/LTM/*.md
!memory/LTM/external_reviews/INDEX.md
!memory/LTM/external_reviews/DIALOGUE_ARCHIVE.md
*.txt
!/requirements_server.txt
!/requirements_sb3.txt
!scripts/r27_g2_runtime_package_manifest.txt
*.tar
!ref/hmasd.tar
ref/hmasd/
ref/OPT-main/
*.png

# Keep the curated N/k/many-agent literature analyses trackable while leaving
# downloaded papers and third-party source trees local-only.
!docs/research/literature/n_k_many_agent_deep_dive/**/*.md
docs/research/literature/n_k_many_agent_deep_dive/code/

